comment Original artwork by David Sundqvist, created for Crossfire and first released in Crossfire 0.93.3 (README dated 1997-04-24).
comment Not present in 0.93.2; added as indoor/altars/altarjeho.111 (24x24 XBM) and altarjeho.111.xpm, files dated 1997-04-15 and 1997-04-16.
comment Renamed from altarjeho to altarvalr in Crossfire 0.95.2 (January 1999) with pixel-identical XPM data.
comment The 0.95.2 altarvalr.111.xpm is byte-identical to the 1999-03-29 CVS import.
comment The 0.93.3 README and CHANGES credit David Sundqvist with many new images and the specialized altars.
comment Converted to PNG by mwedel in 2000, renamed to altarvalr.base.111.png at 32x32 in 2001, recompressed by akirschbaum in 2008.
comment Frame 111 modified (candles moved closer) and animation frames 112-113 added by ryo_saeba on 2011-08-11 (commit 2e0424861).
comment License from the 0.93.3 distribution, which ships the GPL v2 License file and a README notice allowing version 2 or any later version.
comment TODO: confirm ryo_saeba's changes are under the same license.
